- Fix: Quantization is KING. You must use a heavily quantized model (e.g.,
int8
,uint8
). A 7B model can be gigabytes; a quantized 1.1B model can be 100-200MB. Also, ensure it's actually a.tflite
file. If you find a GGUF, you need to convert it to TFLite (a non-trivial step involving tools likellama.cpp
,ONNX Runtime
, andTFLite converter
